# Only the first top-level INBOX project is listed apart; a lowercase Inbox, a nested INBOX and a second INBOX stay under Projects.
file <<END
Work:
	INBOX:
		- nested
Inbox:
	- lower
INBOX:
	- real one
	- real two
INBOX:
	- second
END
keys <C-g>
see │▌ 󰚇 INBOX                                   2 │
see    INBOX                                   1 │
see   Inbox                                     1 │
see   INBOX                                     1 │
keys <Enter>
see - real two
hide - second
quit
